<title>BRAZIL: China buys 150,000 tonnes Brazil soymeal - trader.</title>
<headline>China buys 150,000 tonnes Brazil soymeal - trader.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>China has bought 150,000 tonnes of Brazilian soymeal for May to September delivery, a trader in Brazil confirmed.</p>
<p>&quot;I have confirmation that China has bought 150,000 tonnes of Brazilian soymeal for delivery between May and September,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>The trader was confirming a rumour circulating in Chicago earlier this session.</p>
<p>-- Joelle Diderich, Rio de Janeiro newsroom +55 21 507 4151</p>
</text>
